# Mobile capture desktop preview fit

On the **PC/desktop** view of `/` (`.mobile-demo-stage` + `.phone-frame`):

- The full phone bezel and in-phone UI must fit in the viewport without feeling zoomed-in or cropped.
- Prefer shrinking width/height together (aspect-ratio + max-height) over clipping with overflow.
- Real phones / native app / narrow viewports stay edge-to-edge; this rule is only for the desktop simulator chrome.
